# ── A-Level Hub configuration ────────────────────────────────────────────
# All variables are OPTIONAL. The site works out of the box without any of
# them; Reddit is simply skipped until credentials are provided.

# Path to the SQLite catalog (defaults to ./data/alevelhub.db)
# ALEVELHUB_DB=

# ── Reddit API (free tier) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Enables the "live Reddit search" toggle and the batch reddit scraper.
#
# 1. Sign in to Reddit, then open https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps
# 2. "create another app…" → type: *script* (or web app), any name
# 3. Copy the client id (under the app name) and the secret.
#
# For a *script* app (recommended, personal use):
REDDIT_CLIENT_ID=
REDDIT_CLIENT_SECRET=
REDDIT_USERNAME=
REDDIT_PASSWORD=

# For a *web/installed* app instead, provide a refresh token:
# REDDIT_REFRESH_TOKEN=
#
# The free tier allows 100 queries/minute for non-commercial apps — the
# scraper stays far below that.
